{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bfe6e333569f187200e1b3e0a4f456b644967122a8f341387c87af6496686d03", "ja": "（今日は、亜利沙たちのDVDのお渡し会がある！\nそろそろ開場だけど、設営は……うん、バッチリだな）", "zh": "（今天是亜利沙她们的DVD发放会！马上就要开场了，现场布置……嗯，准备得很完美。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "9bca8c01ebd09f3aaf6256a1a5777aaddd905a5adc2f8ef0620ef372d6038a2c", "ja": "{$P$}さーんっ！\nハァ、ハァ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生——！\n哈啊，哈啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b7b6d142ed431d1a8f54ec61df49d0b07df5ec80a4eae97eeaea823687e71165", "ja": "亜利沙？　どうしたんだ、そんなに急いで。\n出番までもう少しあるのに。", "zh": "亚利沙？怎么了，干吗这么急匆匆的。\n明明离上场还有一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "c8bb95d94b716deaeff7493647e6f906a5c732582158df958f5aa2a3fc79689f", "ja": "き、聞いてください、{$P$}さん！\nありさ、すごいアイディアを思い付いちゃいました。", "zh": "请、请听我说，{$P$}先生！  \n我想到一个超棒的点子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "3eacc9fd3fef4209f74680608cd6c291457fef8ac8327b99a4789d183e1c986c", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、アイドルちゃんの\n一番の魅力的な表情って、どれだと思いますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生觉得，偶像们\n最有魅力的表情是哪一种呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ba5fa7f7522b20807111fdeaab74d2e3cc0d50cbdabb504c5296b80813907a60", "ja": "えっ、いきなりだな、ええと……。\nそう言うなら、やっぱり笑顔じゃないか？", "zh": "咦？也太突然了吧，呃……既然你这么说，那果然还是笑容吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "2afd8b0bb9fa0499f04e7dc829a254f967f3b95be4720bfbe80a6c49ca6f0ef0", "ja": "そう、さすが{$P$}さん！\n笑顔こそが、アイドルちゃんの王道！", "zh": "没错，不愧是{$P$}先生！\n笑容才是偶像们的王道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "bd85225c3dd83ed64ef15b2edd9ee29fbf287641adb8abef067873c9ed507d70", "ja": "中でも、ファンに向けられる笑顔は、\n最上級の尊さであると、ありさは主張しますっ！", "zh": "尤其是面向粉丝的笑容，才是最高等级的珍贵之物——亚利沙要强调这一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b3988b49e178470ad2da5889a14222a74219939266b24558d0761cf1584a9d73", "ja": "なるほど、一理あるな……。\nそれで？", "zh": "原来如此，确实有道理……。\n然后呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "318ba41aa32e6066635e6f66fc498c3edd8251151f03289d548b0b46980d62b2", "ja": "つまり、今日のお渡し会を録画するんですよぉ！\nその動画を、次のDVDに特典として入れるんです。", "zh": "也就是说，要把今天的赠送会录下来呀！\n再把那段视频作为特典收录进下一张DVD里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "8f00cd8404dbe06c456e100df334f917b7cec14441ebf44b2ef80ca095af977d", "ja": "そのお渡し会の映像を、次の特典に……。\nこれぞ、アイドルちゃんの永久機関っ！　どうですか？", "zh": "把这次赠送会的影像放进下一个特典里……这就是偶像的永动机！怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8e792a3c34b24e5769f9cf6d4ee0eb689bbb64a186a79073ba75b961ef804d86", "ja": "面白い発想だとは思うけど……。\nでもそれって、編集作業が大変そうだな。", "zh": "我觉得这个想法挺有意思的，不过……\n但那样一来，剪辑工作好像会很辛苦啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "992f538b8510900a01fc7bc1e216331c3f9ab0a7b25b20dcd4fccc4eb0babfdf", "ja": "それはもちろん、ありさが！　ムフーッ！", "zh": "那当然是亚利沙来啦！哼哼——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d5310c6a08af4f26cb0b95d9e2d58ace608ef38ea063091fd2af733676e56f07", "ja": "うーん……それだとまた亜利沙が無理して、\nフラフラになるんじゃないのか？", "zh": "嗯……那样的话，亜利沙不是又要勉强自己，变得摇摇晃晃的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "9845efb593be49d96240831f91d31aedd79ae08a41dd165b4a404287e0968b66", "ja": "うっ！？　そ、それは……い、いや！\n今度は大丈夫！　大丈夫……だと思います、多分っ！", "zh": "呜！？那、那是……不、不对！\n这次没问题！应该……没问题，大概！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1015_p", "source_sha256": "44df6a690d4a7677cf9cb8e6e9406e9d68f6393dfae594b6abff6b386d66f556", "ja": "頼りないな……確かに、映像に残すのは大切だけど。\nもっと大切なことがあると思うぞ？", "zh": "真不让人放心啊……确实，把影像记录下来很重要，但我觉得还有更重要的事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "e820dad9f1aef144353a04350defcf717d7c7ffd829694efdebda8500618ed73", "ja": "もっと大切なこと？　……はっ！\nありさ、ピンときちゃいましたっ！", "zh": "更重要的事情？……啊！\n亚利沙突然想到啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "f01cef751986d889476c92a416f70ecbed785a0084a07e9963957067fa8a36b9", "ja": "映像より、生のアイドルちゃん！　アイドルちゃんには\nライブ感も大切！　そういうコトですか？", "zh": "比起影像，还是亲眼见到偶像！偶像也很重视现场感！是这个意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1018_p", "source_sha256": "57b8d869d5de00681419067bf871e6b267df95ef07ae40ca58234bee4b6dfb8a", "ja": "そういうこと。今日集まってくれたファンのために、\nまずはお渡し会をしっかりな。", "zh": "就是这样。为了今天特意聚集到这里的粉丝，首先要好好办一场见面会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "cf40f55d03b04dcb40847f05803c0e09db4733733980efe1ff2ddd4c302d9ae8", "ja": "わっかりました、{$P$}さん！\nありさ、頑張っちゃいますよぉ♪", "zh": "收到，{$P$}先生！\n亚利沙会好好努力的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "3029a5fc9650f67f8e24dab3d4d7f87aa765a6ac4a338e2978c41ca4d6a32641", "ja": "レアなアイドルちゃんたちとのひとときを、\nみなさんに楽しんでいただくために……ムフフっ♪", "zh": "为了让大家享受与稀有偶像们共度的时光……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1e8a1244a831f81d9ffc1b3cd12a7c342bc7bb5913a3fa3f5aa548e0a9b07386", "ja": "（たまに暴走する亜利沙だけど、\nそれはアイドルやファンを大切に思ってのことだ）", "zh": "（虽然亚利沙偶尔会兴奋过头，\n但那也是因为她很珍惜偶像和粉丝）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1022_p", "source_sha256": "11a8f26831c7436f9e72896cded52a07c5bc41d0139328e4e2e22015206bc39a", "ja": "（その気持ちは、いつまでも忘れないでほしいな！）", "zh": "（我希望你永远不要忘记这份心情！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0163_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "bcea3df205cfcc244ebf165504bd3d1e30c6ee322158a1cc75068cf8cce08047", "ja": "あ、でも、カメラだけは持ち込みを……？\nいや、今日はライブ感を大切に！　でもカメラ……。", "zh": "啊，不过，相机还是可以带进来……？\n不，今天要重视现场感！可是相机……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
